  "description": "This folding electric bike is equipped with the Copenhagen Wheel from Superpedestrian, a 350W hub motor with integrated battery. The system which is completely contained in the rear hub provides pedal assistance, allowing you to ride farther and longer without tiring. It's perfect for long commutes or hilly areas and can bring the joy of cycling to riders of any experience level.\n\nThe hub is controlled with a iOS or Android smart phone app* so there are no wires, throttles, or external batteries. Choose your level of assistance with Turbo, Standard, or Eco mode and the hub does the rest, providing extra torque when rider input is detected. And at the end of your ride this e-bike folds in seconds for storage or transport.\n\n*iOS or Android smartphone is required to operate Copenhagen Wheel. See specifications below for OS version.\n**Bike and Copenhagen Wheel ship separately and installation is required upon delivery (see details below)",
